<title>USA: MBNA America promoted Spartin to Vice Chairman.</title>
<headline>MBNA America promoted Spartin to Vice Chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBNA America Bank NA, a unit of MBNA Corp, said it has promoted David Spartin to vice Chairman and a member of the company's executive committee.</p>
<p>Spartin, who joined the company in 1991, manages the company's investor, media, community and industry relations.</p>
<p>MBNA is a bank holding company.</p>
